@startuml
actor User
participant GoodsService
participant GoodsMapper

User -> GoodsService: 发起获取餐品列表请求
activate GoodsService
GoodsService -> GoodsMapper: 调用selectGoodsByPageApp方法查询餐品列表
activate GoodsMapper
GoodsMapper --> GoodsService: 返回餐品列表查询结果
deactivate GoodsMapper
loop 处理查询结果
    GoodsService -> GoodsService: 创建分页对象
    GoodsService -> GoodsService: 调用selectGoodsByPageApp方法查询餐品列表
    GoodsService -> GoodsService: 获取查询结果并遍历
    loop 对每个餐品进行判断
        GoodsService -> GoodsService: 判断餐品图片是否为空
        alt 餐品图片非空
            GoodsService -> GoodsService: 调用处理函数处理餐品图片
        else 餐品图片为空
            GoodsService -> GoodsService: 跳过处理
        end
    end
end
GoodsService --> User: 返回处理后的餐品列表结果
deactivate GoodsService
@enduml
